# Capability-model C4 receipt: install is a SIGNED delegation from the
# profile identity, and uninstall revokes it. Install, run (the delegation
# authorizes it), uninstall (the delegation is revoked and the denizen
# un-resides), then confirm the Run row is gone — what it was authorized to
# do stopped being authorized, without destroying its node or world.
# FRESH profile; requires the piccolo feature.
settle 30
key escape

drop-file 200 200 scenarios/fixtures/trail_keeper.lua
settle 10
assert event denizen-staged

act Install trail_keeper
settle 15
assert event denizen-installed
capture 01_installed

act Run trail_keeper
settle 20
assert event denizen-ran
assert focused kept/note
capture 02_ran_under_delegation

act Uninstall trail_keeper
settle 15
assert event denizen-uninstalled
# The node survives revocation: only authority was withdrawn.
assert nodes >= 2
capture 03_revoked

log revocation receipt complete
